<title>BAHRAIN: SAUDI HOLLANDI BANK NINE-MONTH NET RISES.</title>
<headline>SAUDI HOLLANDI BANK NINE-MONTH NET RISES.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to October 30, 1996</p>
<p>		     (million Saudi riyals unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit		  117.3	     vs 101.8</p>
<p> Provisions		   37.5	     vs  37.5</p>
<p> Operating income	  825.1	     vs 801.2</p>
<p> Operating cost	    722.7	     vs 711.3</p>
<p> Net operating income    102.4	     vs  89.9</p>
<p>Note - Traded in the Saudi stock market, the Riyadh-based</p>
<p>Saudi Hollandi Bank is 40 percent owned by the Dutch ABN-Amro</p>
<p>Bank . The rest is held by Saudi investors.</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity	1.21 billion  vs   1.09 billion</p>
<p> Total deposits		9.94 billion  vs   8.98 billion</p>
<p> Assets			 15.87 billion  vs  13.61 billion</p>
</text>
